WEBVTT

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.800
Look down the two columns and you will see them move in opposite directions.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:09.940
As the period shrinks, the frequency grows.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:15.650
Each row states the same fact from a different side, so cover one column and predict it from the other.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.630
The third row is worth remembering, because ten repeats a second is a common figure that you will meet again and again in the laboratory.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.200
[Playback paused]
